> The Duo Module 01 is a compact module with integrated SG2000,
> WI-FI6/BTDM5.4, and eMMC.
> Add only support for UART and SDHCI.
> 
> Signed-off-by: Alexander Sverdlin <alexander.sverdlin@gmail.com>
